# To separate your traces from other application
LANGSMITH_PROJECT=new-agent

# Add API keys for connecting to LLM providers, data sources, and other integrations here
#
# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values there. NEVER put real keys here,
# this file IS committed to git.
#
# Keep .env ASCII only, and keep comments on their own line:
# python-dotenv reads .env with the system locale encoding (GBK on Chinese Windows),
# and an inline "#" comment after a value can end up inside the value.

# --- LangSmith tracing (https://smith.langchain.com) ---
# LANGSMITH_API_KEY=lsv2_....
# LANGSMITH_TRACING=true

# --- LLM providers ---
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-....
# SILICONFLOW_API_KEY=sk-....
